      "function": "other",
      "text": {
        "jp": "<DLG>〈 カイ・カストール 〉\nリベイラ村出身の少年。卓越した身体能力と\n非常に優れた槍の腕前を持ち、大剣闘祭で活躍した。\nまた、彼の左手には不思議な力があり、離れた物に\n火をつけたり、見えないものを見ることができた。\n１４４９年　大剣闘祭の本戦への出場を\n果たしたことを祝し、ここに建立される。",
        "official_en": "<DLG>Cai Castor\nA youth from Ribeira village. His superior athleticism and superb\nspear skills made him a standout in the Heroic Games. Moreover,\nhis left hand gave him the unusual power to set distant things\naflame and see the invisible. This statue was erected in honor\nof his appearance in the main matches of the Heroic Games in\nthe year 1449.",
        "real_en": "<DLG>Kai Castor\nA youth from Ribeira village. His superior athleticism and superb\nspear skills made him a standout in the Heroic Games. Moreover,\nhis left hand gave him the unusual power to set distant things\naflame and see the invisible. This statue was erected in honor\nof his appearance in the main matches of the Heroic Games in\nthe year 1449."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      }
    },
