      "function": "other",
      "text": {
        "jp": "<DLG>〈 ディートリヒ＝グレゴール＝ラミーヌ 〉\nフォドラの地より渡って来た漆黒の剣士。\nその容姿きわめて美しく、見る者すべてを魅了した。\n彼の外套には、影から影へと渡り歩くことができる\n不思議な力があり、多くの対戦者を震え上がらせた。\n１４４９年　大剣闘祭の本戦への出場を\n果たしたことを祝し、ここに建立される。",
        "official_en": "<DLG>Dietrich Gregor Lamine\nA black-clad swordsman from the land of Fódlan. His striking\nappearance captivated all who saw him. The cloak he wore gave\nhim the strange power to walk from shadow to shadow, instilling\nfear in many of his opponents. This statue was erected in honor\nof his appearance in the main matches of the Heroic Games in\nthe year 1449.",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      }
    },
