      "function": "other",
      "text": {
        "jp": "<DLG>〈 レダ 〉\n本名、出身は不明ながら、カーラ神と\n何らかの関わりがあったとされる。\n彼女の持つビウエラの演奏はその素晴らしさ、\n熱情においてこと並ぶ者なく、誰もが心奪われた。\n１４４９年　大剣闘祭の本戦への出場を\n果たしたことを祝し、ここに建立される。",
        "official_en": "<DLG>Leda\nThough her true name and origin are unknown, she was thought to be\nconnected to Kalla's temple in some way. Her vihuela performances\nwere unmatched for skill and passion, stealing the hearts of her\naudiences. This statue was erected in honor of her appearance\nin the main matches of the Heroic Games in the year 1449.",
        "real_en": "<DLG>Leda\nThough her true name and origin are unknown, she was thought to be\nconnected to Cara's temple in some way. Her vihuela performances\nwere unmatched for skill and passion, stealing the hearts of her\naudiences. This statue was erected in honor of her appearance\nin the main matches of the Heroic Games in the year 1449."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      }
    },
