        "authored_group": "MID_LGV_LG00_001_Statue_Bel"
      },
      "function": "other",
      "text": {
        "jp": "<DLG>〈 白髪鬼 〉\n本名はベルトランという、アラゴの人ながら、\nダグシオン市民においては白髪鬼の名のほうが有名だろう。\n彼の持つ斧は凄まじい力を秘めており、過去の\nアラゴ王に縁ある品だったのではないかと噂される。\n１４４９年　大剣闘祭の本戦への出場を\n果たしたことを祝し、ここに建立される。",
        "official_en": "<DLG>The White-Maned Demon\nAn Aragonian whose true name was Bertrand, though he was better\nknown to the citizens of Dagsion as the White-Maned Demon. His axe\nconferred tremendous power and was believed to have belonged to\na previous king of Arago. This statue was erected in honor of his\nappearance in the main matches of the Heroic Games in the year 1449.",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      }
    },
