        "branch_phase": null,
        "authored_group": "MID_LGV_LG00_001_Statue_Tal"
      },
      "function": "other",
      "text": {
        "jp": "<DLG>〈 タリムーン・ヴァンダル 〉\n冒険王ヴァンダルの息子にして、ダグザの地でも\n名の知れたヴァンダル商会の筆頭総支配人。\n卓越した魔道の力と、彼の望んだものを指し示す\n不思議な力を持った羅針盤を愛用していた。\n１４４９年　大剣闘祭の本戦への出場を\n果たしたことを祝し、ここに建立される。",
        "official_en": "<DLG>Talimun Vandahl\nSon of Vandahl, the Swashbuckler King, and the chief executive of\nthe Vandahl Trading Company, which is famed throughout Dagda.\nHe was a skilled sorcerer who often used a compass that pointed him\ndirectly to his desires. This statue was erected in honor of his\nappearance in the main matches of the Heroic Games in the year 1449.",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      }
