      },
      "function": "other",
      "text": {
        "jp": "<DLG>〈 オルヘル 〉\nクレール神殿の祭司という立場にあり、その素顔を\n奇妙な猫の仮面で隠していた、不思議な人物。\n彼女が通ったあとの石畳は、不思議なことに、巨大な\nクサリクの蹄に踏まれたかの如く、割れていたという。\n１４４９年　大剣闘祭の本戦への出場を\n果たしたことを祝し、ここに建立される。",
        "official_en": "<DLG>Orchel\nA lead priest of Credna's temple. She was a secretive woman who hid\nher true face behind a cat mask. Oddly, flagstones she trod on broke\nas if shattering beneath the hooves of a giant kusarik. This statue was\nerected in honor of her appearance in the main matches of the\nHeroic Games in the year 1449.",
        "real_en": "<DLG>Orhel\nA lead priest of Claire's temple. She was a secretive woman who hid\nher true face behind a cat mask. Oddly, flagstones she trod on broke\nas if shattering beneath the hooves of a giant kusarik. This statue was\nerected in honor of her appearance in the main matches of the\nHeroic Games in the year 1449."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      }
    },
